>>
Rule 1 (out dtype must match input to avoid casting error)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) = dtype_(v_1)
>>
Rule 2 (out must have the same shape as input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) = ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_1, i)
>>
Rule 3 (input tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (out tensor, if provided, should not be empty)
{v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) > 0
